  "notable_quotes": [
    "SCXRD and simulations identify the contractive throat and hanging molecular pockets as the features enabling high sieving efficiency and exclusive C3H6 binding.",
    "HAF-1 shows very high C3H6/C3H8 selectivity up to 1.67 × 10^7 at 298 K and higher C3H6 capacity than previously reported molecular sieving adsorbents.",
    "HAF-1 is thermally robust, remaining intact up to 400 °C, and is stable during C3H6/C3H8 separation."
